        "id": 2882982,
        "name": "Peepinglee",
        "username": "Peepinglee",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/peepinglee/{size}/500560_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-01T02:16:46.517Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Id like to offer a suggestion for corporations to be able to make more use of Evermarks.</p>\n<p>My corp currently has 61 million Evermarks but we have no use for them as we are not in an alliance.</p>\n<p>We have a holding for that has structures but we cannot trade the Evermarks to that corp to use them.</p>\n<p>I would very much love to use the evermarks for skinr stuff to do with structures etc, let us use the skinr tool to make designs on our stations, make them more customisable etc</p>\n<p>If there is a reason this cannot be done etc then that’s cool but just putting it out there as i always feel like being able to design more skinr stuff on our structures would be awesome!</p>\n<p>Any feedback on this would be much appreciated, cheers!</p>\n<p>Lee</p>",
