        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/syzygium/{size}/431744_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-01T05:30:23.103Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Peepinglee\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"512453\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://sea1.discourse-cdn.com/eveonline/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/peepinglee/48/500560_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Peepinglee:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We have a holding for that has structures but we cannot trade the Evermarks to that corp to use them.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There you have your solution. Structure skins are a reward for groups that have the courage to hold stations on their own, without hiding behind ‘holding’ constructs to make themselves wardec immune.</p>",
