        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/bdk_eve/{size}/498378_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-01T20:20:49.100Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Buying and selling evermarks/LP via the in-game market is a long overdue concept.</p>\n<p>Downside: Market manipulation, server load<br>\nUpside: Player driven economy increase</p>\n<p>side note: Why are evermarks put on a pedestal? It basically just LP like everything else.</p>\n<p>Put it in the LP section and simplify the wallet <img src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/twitter/victory_hand.png?v=15\" title=\":victory_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":victory_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
