        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.eveonline.com/peepinglee/{size}/500560_2.png",
        "created_at": "2026-06-10T00:06:38.958Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We can defend them fine thank you.</p>\n<p>Why should we not have our own structures? Where in this conversation have i said i wish to be left alone and so on…</p>\n<p>Also what does this have to do with ever marks? and the purpose of this conversation?</p>\n<p>Take a chill pill bud!</p>\n<p>If you are just here to be toxic then take it elsewhere as i aint interested.</p>\n<p>Cheers, Lee</p>",
